text = "SPACE or CLICK new seed    LEFT RIGHT seed -1 +1    WHEEL zooms
1..5 stop after that pass    S rooms / cave

L links by nearest neighbour instead of a spanning tree
K fill the unreachable back in

go back to a seed you liked with the arrows: the same number is
the same dungeon, always. all the knobs are on DungeonGen
in the inspector and rebuild while the game runs."
